      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This specific oculus only problem has been an issue since they updated to Unity 2018. Nobody seems to be able to identify what the cause is. The only workaround is to increase your TdrDelay to around 6 seconds so that the GPU can recover from the consistent multi second freezes in vrchat.\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/oculus-rift-random-game-freeze\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/vrchat-randomly-crashes-to-desktop-with-no-error",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
